                                "sense_id": "2c5283eb-c8f9-3c45-b6c0-cdd153b26571",
                                "text": "[…] we are convinced, from considerable experience and observation, that the class of diseases described by Sir James as unsuited to the climate of Pau, et vice versâ […]"
