                                "sense_id": "2c5283eb-c8f9-3c45-b6c0-cdd153b26571",
                                "text": "Reggie was a “release” from Guiding Eyes; he kept leading his trainers into light poles, so he was deemed temperamentally unsuited to be a service dog."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
